@startuml
title RPRRSBSI-V4 Tags Expert System — ruled Tag slice through 2026-08-30
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam entity {
  BackgroundColor #F0F4FF
  BorderColor #3366CC
}

package "ATAPUtilities (C-08)" {
  entity TagNamespace {
    * TagNamespaceId : durable identity <<PK>>
    --
    NamespaceCode : immutable <<UQ>>
  }

  entity TagNamespaceSteward {
    * TagNamespaceStewardId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    TagNamespaceId : identity <<FK>>
    PrincipalId : required opaque actor
    SourceReference : provenance
    OccurredAtUtc : source event instant
    RecordedAtUtc : recording instant
    StewardHistory : retained
  }

  entity Tag {
    * TagId : durable identity <<PK>>
    --
    PhiloteId : identity <<FK>>
    TagNamespaceId : identity <<FK>>
    TagCode : immutable canonical code
  }

  entity PhiloteValidityPeriod {
    * PhiloteValidityPeriodId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    PhiloteId : identity <<FK>>
    ValidFromUtc : instant
    ValidToUtc : instant?
  }

  entity TagState {
    * TagStateId : state identity <<PK>>
    --
    TagId : durable identity <<FK>>
    ValidFromUtc : instant
    ValidToUtc : instant?
    Label : temporal payload
    Description : temporal payload
    SuccessorTagId : required unless erroneous <<FK>>
    WithdrawalReason : required when erroneous
  }

  entity TagAliasType {
    * TagAliasTypeId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    AliasTypeCode : controlled vocabulary <<UQ>>
  }

  entity TagAlias {
    * TagAliasId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    TagId : durable identity <<FK>>
    TagAliasTypeId : identity <<FK>>
    AliasCode : non-canonical code
    ValidFromUtc : instant
    ValidToUtc : instant?
  }

  entity TagRelationType {
    * TagRelationTypeId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    RelationTypeCode : controlled code <<UQ>>
  }

  entity TagRelation {
    * TagRelationId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    EndpointATagId : durable identity <<FK>>
    EndpointBTagId : durable identity <<FK>>
    TagRelationTypeId : identity <<FK>>
  }

  entity TagAssignment {
    * TagAssignmentId : identity <<PK>>
    --
    TagId : durable identity <<FK>>
    EntityType : pending C-21
    EntityId : typed endpoint
  }

  entity "C-14 namespace/code collision trigger" as AliasTrigger <<trigger>>
  entity "C-15 transactional retraction procedure" as RetractPath <<write path>>
  entity "C-15 sanctioned as-of resolver" as ResolvePath <<read path>>
}

TagNamespace ||--o{ TagNamespaceSteward : records history
TagNamespace ||--o{ Tag : scopes canonical code
Tag ||--o{ PhiloteValidityPeriod : identity lifespan
Tag ||--o{ TagState : payload history
Tag ||--o{ TagAlias : owns namespace-local alias
TagAliasType ||--o{ TagAlias : types
TagRelationType ||--o{ TagRelation : types
Tag ||--o{ TagRelation : durable endpoint A
Tag ||--o{ TagRelation : durable endpoint B
Tag ||--o{ TagAssignment : durable endpoint
TagState }o--> Tag : successor unless erroneous

AliasTrigger ..> Tag : checks canonical codes
AliasTrigger ..> TagAlias : checks every alias ever
RetractPath ..> PhiloteValidityPeriod : closes or gaps
RetractPath ..> TagState : appends terminal state
ResolvePath ..> PhiloteValidityPeriod : resolves identity as-of
ResolvePath ..> TagState : resolves payload as-of

note right of TagNamespaceSteward
  Self-steward on namespace creation.
  Co-stewards and transfer history required.
  Active stewardship gates initial authoring.
  Generalized approval workflow is deferred.
end note

note right of TagState
  No Philote on TagState.
  State interval must be contained by
  the Tag Philote validity coverage.
  Multi-hop is allowed; cycles are rejected.
  Resolve to first active terminal successor.
  Erroneous withdrawal has reason, no successor.
end note

note bottom of TagAlias
  Temporal as-of alias, but permanent code claim.
  Retired aliases are included in trigger checks.
  Codes use Latin1_General_100_CI_AS_SC.
  Trigger behavior/performance validates on Express.
end note

note bottom of TagRelation
  D-6/C-05 and C-12 currently require durable roots.
  C-22 must explicitly reconcile roots vs exact states.
  Weight/traversal behavior is HITL-PENDING C-19.
end note

note bottom of TagAssignment
  Active TagState resolves as-of.
  C-21 EntityType codes and C-27 confidence
  are HITL-PENDING. C-16 provenance is required.
end note

legend bottom
  Normative slice includes C-16, C-20, C-26, FU-4, FU-6.
  One authoritative ATAPUtilities catalog; no initial tenant discriminator.
  HITL-PENDING: D-3 cases, C-17..C-19, C-21..C-25, C-27.
  No SQL, seed identity, live inventory, localization,
  ordering, or authorization invariant is inferred.
endlegend
@enduml
